    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/effaf0bf1837d199a453d57088366a99.poster.avif?t=1755694504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/effaf0bf1837d199a453d57088366a99.webm?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/effaf0bf1837d199a453d57088366a99.mp4?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bite the Crown casts players as a sentient mold, an anomaly born in the depths of a packaging factory, seeking to overthrow the ruthless Snack King. To dismantle the tyrannical regime, you must build and lead a covert rebel organization, recruiting oppressed snacks and orchestrating daring missions to weaken the kingdom from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/0610e9d26a6c03b2a59657a1116e1122.avif?t=1755694504\" data-has-big width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and manage resources to expand your secret hideout, transforming it into a fully operational resistance base. Recruit discarded, expired, and rebellious snacks, assigning them to critical missions that sabotage the king\u2019s supply chains, infiltrate factories, and rescue imprisoned allies before they\u2019re sealed away forever. Strengthen your movement by upgrading specialized weapons, developing intelligence networks, and striking where the enemy least expects it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/7e5e83f57de5b7fa40beec8ebe3526da.poster.avif?t=1755694504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/7e5e83f57de5b7fa40beec8ebe3526da.webm?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/7e5e83f57de5b7fa40beec8ebe3526da.mp4?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/973a630997aa0df866b04818c3aa35af.avif?t=1755694504\" data-has-big width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the Snack Kingdom\u2019s sprawling, ever-changing districts, where the king\u2019s enforcers and mechanized food warriors patrol the land. Use your agility, combat prowess, and unpredictable nature to fight back against waves of loyalist forces, dismantling the regime one battle at a time. Take down the king\u2019s high-ranking officers, absorb their secrets, and turn their power against them as you carve a path toward the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/4e91aea20d115d0e885f392450780c0d.poster.avif?t=1755694504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/4e91aea20d115d0e885f392450780c0d.webm?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/4e91aea20d115d0e885f392450780c0d.mp4?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/3ea975ed7cc38cc9b5ef6a247d9fe91d.avif?t=1755694504\" data-has-big width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your influence across the kingdom by carrying out high-stakes missions, toppling supply routes, and turning factory workers into operatives of the cause. Unravel the dark secrets behind the Snack King\u2019s rule and awaken the oppressed to the reality of their world. Will you have what it takes to erode the empire and take a bite out of the crown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/6b9028697e61a98bfa1d8c7d75337608.poster.avif?t=1755694504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/6b9028697e61a98bfa1d8c7d75337608.webm?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/6b9028697e61a98bfa1d8c7d75337608.mp4?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/effaf0bf1837d199a453d57088366a99.poster.avif?t=1755694504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/effaf0bf1837d199a453d57088366a99.webm?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/effaf0bf1837d199a453d57088366a99.mp4?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bite the Crown casts players as a sentient mold, an anomaly born in the depths of a packaging factory, seeking to overthrow the ruthless Snack King. To dismantle the tyrannical regime, you must build and lead a covert rebel organization, recruiting oppressed snacks and orchestrating daring missions to weaken the kingdom from within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/0610e9d26a6c03b2a59657a1116e1122.avif?t=1755694504\" data-has-big width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather and manage resources to expand your secret hideout, transforming it into a fully operational resistance base. Recruit discarded, expired, and rebellious snacks, assigning them to critical missions that sabotage the king\u2019s supply chains, infiltrate factories, and rescue imprisoned allies before they\u2019re sealed away forever. Strengthen your movement by upgrading specialized weapons, developing intelligence networks, and striking where the enemy least expects it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/7e5e83f57de5b7fa40beec8ebe3526da.poster.avif?t=1755694504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/7e5e83f57de5b7fa40beec8ebe3526da.webm?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/7e5e83f57de5b7fa40beec8ebe3526da.mp4?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/973a630997aa0df866b04818c3aa35af.avif?t=1755694504\" data-has-big width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Venture into the Snack Kingdom\u2019s sprawling, ever-changing districts, where the king\u2019s enforcers and mechanized food warriors patrol the land. Use your agility, combat prowess, and unpredictable nature to fight back against waves of loyalist forces, dismantling the regime one battle at a time. Take down the king\u2019s high-ranking officers, absorb their secrets, and turn their power against them as you carve a path toward the throne.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/4e91aea20d115d0e885f392450780c0d.poster.avif?t=1755694504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/4e91aea20d115d0e885f392450780c0d.webm?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/4e91aea20d115d0e885f392450780c0d.mp4?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/3ea975ed7cc38cc9b5ef6a247d9fe91d.avif?t=1755694504\" data-has-big width=1560 height=163 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your influence across the kingdom by carrying out high-stakes missions, toppling supply routes, and turning factory workers into operatives of the cause. Unravel the dark secrets behind the Snack King\u2019s rule and awaken the oppressed to the reality of their world. Will you have what it takes to erode the empire and take a bite out of the crown?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/6b9028697e61a98bfa1d8c7d75337608.poster.avif?t=1755694504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/6b9028697e61a98bfa1d8c7d75337608.webm?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3564750/extras/6b9028697e61a98bfa1d8c7d75337608.mp4?t=1755694504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "In a world ruled by sugary tyrants, an unlikely hero rises from the shadows: Pom the Mold. Build your secret guild, gather rogue treats, lead the rebellion and battle through candy-coated chaos to topple the Candy Kingdom. The Sweet Revolution begins\u2014bite back!",
